Description Pristine graphene band structure
Prefix generate

TypeOfSystem Graphene

TB.Hopping 3.1

CellSize 1
SuperCell 1

Calculate.OnlyDOS .false.
Kubo.Calc .false.
Diag.Calc .true.
Calculate.Bands .true.

Bands.NumPoints 20
&begin Bands.Path 4
2/3  1/3  0.0  # K
0.0  0.0  0.0  # Gamma
0.5  0.0  0.0  # M
2/3  1/3  0.0  # K'
&end Bands.Path

TB.NeighLevels 1
Neigh.CompareAll .true.
nonBulkSmall .true.

WriteDataFiles .false.
WritePos .false.
